{{also|Mê Kông}}
==English==
{{wikipedia}}
===Etymology===
From {{etyl|th|hu}} {{m|th|แม่โขง}}, contracted form of {{m|th|แม่น้ำโขง}}. Cognate with {{etyl|lo|hu}} {{m|lo|ນ້ຳຂອງ}} or {{m|lo|ແມ່ນ້ຳຂອງ}}.

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{place|en|river|in southeastern|cont/Asia}} that flows about 4,183 km (2,600 miles) from [[Tibet]] to the [[South China Sea]] in [[Vietnam]].

